WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
It's useless to say this now

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:03,360
My benefactor was secretly killed by our father.

3
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:04,960
Even his home was destroyed today

4
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:06,120
But then again

5
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:08,040
According to what I know from your correspondence with him

6
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:10,280
That little girl is most likely not a person who doesn't know right from wrong.

7
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:13,160
My cheap benefactor did this wrong, right?

8
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:15,200
To be honest, I should also thank her

9
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:16,640
You really deserve thanks

10
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:18,200
Otherwise, after the banquet that day

11
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:20,840
You might be engaged to your cheap cousin

12
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:23,120
Compared to being suppressed by a man for a lifetime

13
00:00:23,120 --> 00:00:25,520
After being pressed down by a stone, it obviously changed a lot.

14
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:26,720
What nonsense are you talking about?

15
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:28,440
Just telling the truth

16
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:30,660
Aren't men and women the same thing?

17
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:31,860
I won’t talk to you anymore

18
00:00:31,860 --> 00:00:32,820
I'm going to sleep

19
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:34,060
let's sleep together

20
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:35,060
remember what i said

21
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:37,140
That day I really couldn’t hide it, so I begged me

22
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:39,180
For the sake of us being the same person

23
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:40,460
I might be able to help you

24
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:41,460
I don't need you to touch

25
00:00:42,780 --> 00:00:45,640
Some things are beyond your control

26
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:47,370
I said Yuer

27
00:00:47,370 --> 00:00:49,050
You said we should kill your bad guy

28
00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:54,530
How about wooing me over, Miss?

29
00:00:54,530 --> 00:00:56,900
The bad guys have already rejected you

30
00:00:56,900 --> 00:00:58,300
Is there still a chance?

31
00:01:01,790 --> 00:01:04,220
Opportunities are for those who are prepared

32
00:01:04,220 --> 00:01:05,500
I don't believe it

33
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:08,180
And the man who my iron-wire wife can’t stand

34
00:01:08,180 --> 00:01:09,540
Then leave it to you, miss.

35
00:01:09,540 --> 00:01:11,860
Tie her back and tell us a story

36
00:01:11,860 --> 00:01:14,620
She hasn't finished telling the story she promised me last time.
